<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - July 4.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - July 4.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay  Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement at the Mid-session of Friday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day and their percentage contribution to the net change. The index at 12:30pm was 4337.07,13.61 points or 0.31 percent higher than Thursday's close.</p>
